    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Alerts raised, by scenario",
      "description": "Cumulative since the container started. This is the readout for the Phase 3 observation week: look for offby1/caddy-per-ip-ratelimit, and check whether any listed address looks like a real player rather than a scanner.",
